        "githubCommitAuthorEmail": "noreply@anthropic.com",
        "githubCommitMessage": "Enforce read-only Odoo and Shopify; Odoo sales sync a day at a time\n\nOdoo calls are limited to an allowlist of read methods and Shopify to GraphQL\nqueries; anything else is refused before a request is sent, with tests.\nOdoo sales are read and saved one day at a time, so a slow server keeps\nevery day it finished, and an hourly job fills in the 90 days. Sales orders\ncount under their warehouse (the showroom). The stock sync only looks up\nthe Odoo products behind Shopify SKUs instead of the whole catalogue.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011KVYufKSy8VP5QTTKP9kje",
